 "Rookery builds a lesson path around you. Take a short placement test, or pick the level that fits. You can change it any time in Settings.": "Rookery siz uchun dars yo'lini tuzadi. Qisqa daraja aniqlash testini topshiring yoki mos darajani tanlang. Uni istalgan vaqt Sozlamalarda o'zgartirishingiz mumkin.",
 "Take the placement test": "Daraja aniqlash testini topshirish",
 "{n} short questions about rules, tactics, openings and endgames. About 8 minutes. Recommended.": "Qoidalar, taktika, debyut va endshpil haqida {n} ta qisqa savol. Taxminan 8 daqiqa. Tavsiya etiladi.",
 "You already know roughly how well you play.": "Qanchalik yaxshi o'ynashingizni taxminan bilasiz.",
 "Pick your level": "Darajangizni tanlang",
 "Unsure? The placement test will tell you — your result is an estimate, and you can always change level later.": "Ishonchingiz komil emasmi? Daraja aniqlash testi aytib beradi — natija taxminiy, darajani keyin ham o'zgartirishingiz mumkin.",
 "Beginner": "Boshlovchi",
 "Knows little or nothing about chess.": "Shaxmat haqida kam narsa biladi yoki umuman bilmaydi.",
 "Learn how the pieces move, what check and checkmate mean, and a few opening ideas.": "Figuralar qanday yurishini, shoh va mat nima ekanini hamda bir nechta debyut g'oyalarini o'rganing.",
 "Elementary": "Boshlang'ich",
 "Understands the rules and basic tactics.": "Qoidalarni va oddiy taktikani tushunadi.",
 "Spot forks, pins and skewers, defend your pieces and find short checkmates.": "Vilka, bog'lash va tikishlarni payqang, figuralaringizni himoya qiling va qisqa matlarni toping.",
 "Intermediate": "O'rta",
 "Understands tactics and basic positional ideas.": "Taktikani va oddiy pozitsion g'oyalarni tushunadi.",
 "Combine tactics, plan around weaknesses and convert rook endgames.": "Taktikalarni birlashtiring, zaif joylar atrofida reja tuzing va rux endshpillarini g'alabaga aylantiring.",
 "Advanced": "Ilg'or",
 "Handles complex tactics and strategic positions.": "Murakkab taktika va strategik pozitsiyalarni uddalaydi.",
 "Calculate candidate moves, prevent your opponent's plans and prepare your openings.": "Nomzod yurishlarni hisoblang, raqibingiz rejalarining oldini oling va debyutlaringizni tayyorlang.",
 "Expert": "Ekspert",
