 "Resume": "Davom ettirish",
 "Quick pairing with a player of your strength. Rated or casual.": "Kuchingizdagi o'yinchi bilan tez juftlash. Reytingli yoki oddiy.",
 "Needs the Rookery server — not available in this copy.": "Rookery serveri kerak — bu nusxada mavjud emas.",
