 "Your lessons, puzzles and achievements are saved with your account and follow you to other devices. Settings and the offline cache stay in this browser.": "Darslar, boshqotirmalar va yutuqlaringiz hisobingiz bilan saqlanadi va boshqa qurilmalarga ham o'tadi. Sozlamalar va oflayn kesh shu brauzerda qoladi.",
 "Your level, progress and settings are stored <b>only on this device and in this browser</b> (IndexedDB). Clearing your browser data erases them. Sign in to sync your progress between devices.": "Darajangiz, taraqqiyotingiz va sozlamalaringiz <b>faqat shu qurilmada va shu brauzerda</b> (IndexedDB) saqlanadi. Brauzer ma'lumotlarini tozalash ularni o'chiradi. Taraqqiyotni qurilmalar o'rtasida sinxronlash uchun kiring.",
 "Current password": "Joriy parol",
 "New password": "Yangi parol",
 "<b>Stockfish 19 ready</b> — runs on this device in a background worker, no internet needed. Response {ms} ms.": "<b>Stockfish 19 tayyor</b> — shu qurilmada fon jarayonida ishlaydi, internet kerak emas. Javob vaqti {ms} ms.",
 "<b>Built-in engine ready</b> — runs on this device ({mode}), no internet needed. Response {ms} ms. It is a compact alpha-beta search engine (8 levels).": "<b>O'rnatilgan dvigatel tayyor</b> — shu qurilmada ({mode}) ishlaydi, internet kerak emas. Javob vaqti {ms} ms. Bu ixcham alfa-beta qidiruv dvigateli (8 daraja).",
 "Tournaments need the Rookery server": "Turnirlar uchun Rookery serveri kerak",
