 "Watching needs the Rookery server": "Kuzatish uchun Rookery serveri kerak",
 "Live games are only available when Rookery runs with its server.": "Jonli o'yinlar faqat Rookery server bilan ishlaganda mavjud.",
 "moves": "yurish",
 "Watch": "Kuzatish",
 "Live games": "Jonli o'yinlar",
 "Follow the strongest games happening right now. Moves and clocks update live.": "Hozir o'ynalayotgan eng kuchli o'yinlarni kuzating. Yurishlar va soatlar jonli yangilanadi.",
 "Top game": "Eng yaxshi o'yin",
 "Watch this game": "Bu o'yinni kuzatish",
 "More games": "Boshqa o'yinlar",
 "No games right now": "Hozir o'yinlar yo'q",
 "When players start games you can watch them here. Start one yourself!": "O'yinchilar o'yin boshlaganda ularni shu yerda kuzatishingiz mumkin. O'zingiz ham birini boshlang!",
 "Bullet": "Bulet",
 "Blitz": "Blits",
 "Rapid": "Rapid",
 "Classical": "Klassika",
 "King and queen vs king": "Shoh va farzin shohga qarshi",
 "Use the queen to shrink the box around the king, then bring your own king closer. Watch out for stalemate!": "Farzin bilan shoh atrofidagi qutini toraytiring, so'ng o'z shohingizni yaqinlashtiring. Patdan ehtiyot bo'ling!",
 "King and rook vs king": "Shoh va rux shohga qarshi",
 "Cut the king off with the rook, push it to the edge, and use the opposition to give mate.": "Rux bilan shohni kesib qo'ying, chetga suring va oppozitsiya yordamida mat qo'ying.",
 "Rook mate with the king cornered": "Shoh burchakda: rux bilan mat",
 "The enemy king is already near the edge. Find the quickest way to mate.": "Raqib shohi allaqachon chetga yaqin. Mat qo'yishning eng tez yo'lini toping.",
 "Back-rank mate": "Oxirgi gorizontalda mat",
 "The black king has no escape squares. Is there a check that cannot be blocked?": "Qora shohning qochadigan katagi yo'q. To'sib bo'lmaydigan shoh bormi?",
 "Two bishops vs king": "Ikki fil shohga qarshi",
 "Two bishops on neighbouring diagonals form a wall. Drive the king to a corner.": "Qo'shni diagonallardagi ikki fil devor hosil qiladi. Shohni burchakka haydang.",
 "King and pawn vs king: win": "Shoh va piyoda shohga qarshi: g'alaba",
 "Your king is in front of the pawn on the sixth rank: that wins. Keep the opposition and promote.": "Shohingiz oltinchi gorizontalda piyoda oldida: bu g'alaba beradi. Oppozitsiyani saqlang va piyodani o'tkazing.",
 "Rook and pawn vs king": "Rux va piyoda shohga qarshi",
 "Cut the king off along a file with the rook, then march the pawn forward with your king.": "Rux bilan shohni vertikal bo'ylab kesib qo'ying, so'ng shohingiz bilan piyodani oldinga olib boring.",
 "Opposition: hold the draw": "Oppozitsiya: durangni saqlang",
 "You are Black. Keep your king in front of the pawn and take the opposition whenever you can.": "Siz qora bilan o'ynaysiz. Shohingizni piyoda oldida tuting va imkon bo'lsa oppozitsiyani oling.",
 "Lucena position": "Lucena pozitsiyasi",
 "Build a bridge: bring the rook to the fourth rank, step out with the king and shelter behind the rook.": "Ko'prik quring: ruxni to'rtinchi gorizontalga olib boring, shoh bilan chiqing va rux ortidan panoh toping.",
 "Philidor position: hold the draw": "Filidor pozitsiyasi: durangni saqlang",
 "You are Black. Keep the rook on the sixth rank until the pawn advances, then check from behind.": "Siz qora bilan o'ynaysiz. Piyoda oldinga yurmaguncha ruxni oltinchi gorizontalda tuting, so'ng orqadan shoh bering.",
 "Bishop and knight vs king": "Fil va ot shohga qarshi",
 "The hardest basic mate: drive the king to a corner of the bishop's colour, using the \"W\" knight manoeuvre.": "Eng qiyin asosiy mat: shohni filning rangidagi burchakka haydang, otning “W” manevridan foydalaning.",
 "Basic mates": "Asosiy matlar",
 "Essential endings": "Muhim endshpillar",
 "Classic positions": "Klassik pozitsiyalar",
 "Flank & unusual openings": "Qanot va noodatiy debyutlar",
 "Semi-open games (1.e4, not 1…e5)": "Yarim ochiq o'yinlar (1.e4, 1…e5 emas)",
 "Open games & French": "Ochiq o'yinlar va Fransuz",
 "Closed games & Queen's Gambit": "Yopiq o'yinlar va Farzin gambiti",
 "Indian defences": "Hind himoyalari",
 "Both sides claim the centre. Open lines, quick development and early tactics.": "Ikkala tomon ham markazni egallaydi. Ochiq chiziqlar, tez rivojlanish va erta taktika.",
 "White sacrifices a pawn for a strong centre and an open f-file. Sharp and romantic.": "Oq kuchli markaz va ochiq f vertikali uchun piyodani qurbon qiladi. O'tkir va romantik.",
 "Black mirrors White and counter-attacks e4. Very solid, often drawish.": "Qora oqni takrorlaydi va e4 ga qarshi hujum qiladi. Juda ishonchli, ko'pincha durangga moyil.",
 "White opens the centre at once. Direct, clear plans.": "Oq markazni darhol ochadi. To'g'ridan-to'g'ri, aniq rejalar.",
 "Develop quickly and aim at f7. A great opening for learning chess principles.": "Tez rivojlaning va f7 ga nishon oling. Shaxmat tamoyillarini o'rganish uchun ajoyib debyut.",
 "A pawn for rapid development and a big centre.": "Tez rivojlanish va katta markaz uchun bir piyoda.",
 "The \"quiet game\": White prepares d4.": "“Sokin o'yin”: oq d4 ga tayyorlanadi.",
 "Pressure on the knight that guards e5. One of the oldest and richest openings.": "e5 ni himoya qilayotgan otga bosim. Eng qadimgi va eng boy debyutlardan biri.",
 "Black fights for the centre from the side and plays for a win. The most popular reply to 1.e4.": "Qora markaz uchun yon tomondan kurashadi va g'alabaga o'ynaydi. 1.e4 ga eng mashhur javob.",
 "The favourite of Fischer and Kasparov: flexible and combative.": "Fisher va Kasparovning sevimlisi: moslashuvchan va jangovar.",
 "Black builds a solid pawn chain and strikes with ...d5. Strategic play.": "Qora mustahkam piyodalar zanjirini quradi va ...d5 bilan zarba beradi. Strategik o'yin.",
 "Solid and reliable: Black prepares ...d5 without blocking the bishop.": "Mustahkam va ishonchli: qora filni to'smasdan ...d5 ga tayyorlanadi.",
 "Black challenges e4 immediately. Easy to learn.": "Qora e4 ga darhol qarshi chiqadi. O'rganish oson.",
 "White offers a pawn to deflect Black's central pawn. Not a true gambit: White regains it.": "Oq qoraning markaziy piyodasini chalg'itish uchun piyoda taklif qiladi. Haqiqiy gambit emas: oq uni qaytarib oladi.",
 "Black supports d5 with a pawn and keeps the bishop free.": "Qora d5 ni piyoda bilan qo'llab-quvvatlaydi va filni erkin qoldiradi.",
 "A solid, easy-to-learn system: develop the same pieces to the same squares against almost anything.": "Mustahkam, o'rganish oson tizim: deyarli har qanday o'yinga qarshi bir xil donalarni bir xil kataklarga chiqaring.",
 "Black lets White build a big centre, then attacks it. Rich in kingside attacks.": "Qora oqqa katta markaz qurishga yo'l qo'yadi, keyin unga hujum qiladi. Shoh qanotidagi hujumlarga boy.",
 "Black pins the knight and fights for e4. A favourite of top players.": "Qora otni bog'laydi va e4 uchun kurashadi. Eng kuchli o'yinchilarning sevimlisi.",
 "White's bishop on g2 pressures the long diagonal.": "Oqning g2 dagi fili uzun diagonalga bosim o'tkazadi.",
 "A flexible flank opening: White controls d5 and keeps options open.": "Moslashuvchan qanot debyuti: oq d5 ni nazorat qiladi va imkoniyatlarni ochiq qoldiradi.",
 "White develops first and decides on the pawn structure later.": "Oq avval rivojlanadi, piyoda tuzilmasini keyin hal qiladi.",
